      241   with view-as dialog-box side-labels no-underline three-d scrollable
      242        title "":U default-button b-Quit cancel-button b-Quit.
      243   assign frame fr-D-host-rsn :scrollable = no.
      244   on choose of b-OK in frame fr-D-host-rsn do:
      245   define variable vss-include-info2 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
      246   if lookup(self :type
      247            ,'BROWSE,FILL-IN,FRAME,BUTTON,RADIO-SET,COMBO-BOX,SELECTION-LIST,CONTROL-FRAME,SLIDER,DIALOG-BOX,TOGGLE-BOX,EDITOR,WINDOW'
      248            ) = 0
      249   then do:
